# build output
build/
*.nro
*.elf
*.nacp
*.map

# Game files -- NEVER commit these. They belong to Rockstar and must be
# supplied by each user from their own copy of the APK.
*.so
*.wad
*.m4v
*.apk

# Local working directories -- none of this belongs in the repo.
# PORT/ is a copy of the SD card (game WADs, libGame.so: ~2GB, Rockstar's).
# MOD/  is the CLEO mod pack it was originally built against: someone else's
#       work, kept only as reference while the menu was being reimplemented
#       natively, and no longer used by the build at all.
# NRO/  is a built binary.
PORT/
MOD/
NRO/
MODINFO/
